{title: Its The Holy Ghost And Fire}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]It's the Holy Ghost and fire keeping me alive
[D]Keeping me alive, [G]keeping me alive.
[G]It's the Holy Ghost and fire keeping me alive
Jesus is keeping me a[G]live.

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]It feels like fire shut up in my bones.
[D]It feels like fire shut up in my [G]bones.
[G]It feels like fire shut up in my bones.
Fire shut up in my [G]bones.

{comment: Verse 3}
[G]It's all over me and it's keeping me alive,
[D]Keeping me alive, [G]Keeping me alive.
